    "description": "Technical and Development Lead for several Agile projects utilizing enterprise eCommerce platforms including Sitecore Commerce , Oracle Cloud Commerce, and experienced in on-premise Oracle Commerce (ATG)\n\nCertified Sitecore Experience Platform and Sitecore Experience Commerce developer experienced in .Net MVC and Sitecore JSS implementation. \n\nHeadless development with both Java and Microsoft frameworks (REST APIs and OData), via JavaScript frameworks such as JQuery, React, and Knockout\n\nJava/J2EE fullstack development utilizing & extending the Oracle (formerly ATG) Commerce Suite. \n\nExperienced with Endeca search and personalization platform. \n\nIn depth knowledge of both Oracle commerce & Sitecore personalization/merchandising tools. \n\nOne of the first adopters of Oracle Cloud Commerce, and a SME of Cloud Commerce development and management.\n\nIntimate knowledge/experience with integrating ERP solutions such as EBS, SAP, Communicorp within an eCommerce platform via REST, as well as legacy SOAP & XML.  \n\nInstated industry standard development best practices in line with Agile methodologies. Familiar with kanban, scrum and scrumban project planning and milestone delivery. This also includes integrating CI software with project management platforms such as JIRA.",
